        "description": "<p>\n  The Python Software Foundation (PSF) is excited to announce our newest staff\n  member and Infrastructure Engineer,\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/jmcshannon\">Joshua Mcshannon</a>, reporting to\n  Director of Engineering Jacob Coffee. Joshua brings over 16 years of technical\n  expertise from various backgrounds including bootstrapped startups and big\n  tech. Most recently he built an AI-integrated learning platform for\n  cybersecurity students and taught secure web application development along\n  with DevOps/platform engineering.\n</p>\n\n<div style=\"padding: 1em 0px; text-align: center;\">\n  <a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-dlftuaxO6vA/auj6HezTZ1I/AAAAAAAAA2g/z7Omo6TJqSsmhWqL3Y7pruSitgM24TpnQCK4BGAsYHQ/s1999/image1.jpg\">\n    <img alt=\"Joshua at an outdoor fall festival with a stroller\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-dlftuaxO6vA/auj6HezTZ1I/AAAAAAAAA2g/z7Omo6TJqSsmhWqL3Y7pruSitgM24TpnQCK4BGAsYHQ/s200/image1.jpg\" style=\"height: auto; max-width: 100%;\" />",
